  "_comment": "Served at runtime as /symbology-config.json (or via API). Editing this file changes map symbology immediately for anyone who reloads the page, or instantly for connected users if your backend broadcasts a 'symbology-updated' socket event after saving (see useSymbologyLiveReload.js). No frontend rebuild or redeploy needed.",

